      <activity id="f9ade40a-dbb1-54a5-92d1-df5124d7de56" activityNameId="7d8c30c7-08b6-535d-b935-e2410d41c1bb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Electronic component, passive, unspecified, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Electronic component, passive, unspecified, at plant
This module represents an unweighted average of all passive components on a desktop motherboard, a laptop mainboard and a CRT TV board. In 2023, no major updates are implemented for this dataset, except for the use of updated ICT datasets in the background/inventory, e.g. capacitors, inductors, resistors, etc.; UUID: 3bc3ee2f-7516-3efa-923c-20251484c334
This dataset covers material input (and within this the respective production efforts) for unspecified passive electronic components.
Location: Data represent a global valuable average composition of passive electronic components.
Technology: see general comments
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: Literature &amp; own estimations
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3bc3ee2f-7516-3efa-923c-20251484c334.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
